{"asset_key":"ep6/env_story_16311490","episode":"ep6","category":"env_story","story_id":"16311490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1631149001:1":{"text":"Lorence... do you think that person is listening in on us?","source_cn":"劳伦斯，那个人是不是在看我们啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB52ECC04791FEB86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1631149002:1":{"text":"Don't worry about them. Maybe they're just... lost.","source_cn":"别管他，说不定只是个迷路的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF9A6C5A34DEA286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1631149003:0":{"text":"But if they hang around too long, we might have to move somewhere else.","source_cn":"但要是他再待一会儿，我们可能就得换个地方了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BDE57CADED55F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1631149004:1":{"text":"... So, about the dance you mentioned next week...","source_cn":"……所以，你刚才说下周的舞会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0406F4393BFFBC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1631149005:0":{"text":"Huh? Oh, right... the dance. I'll make sure my outfit's ready.","source_cn":"啊？哦，对……舞会……我会准备好礼服的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E39D8CDC5CF3388","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1631149006:1":{"text":"Honestly... I just wish it were only the two of us, you know?","source_cn":"咳……要是只有我们两个就好了，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBA80B5C777E9E0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1631149007:1":{"text":"Shh! Keep your voice down... we don't want anyone misunderstanding.","source_cn":"嘘！你小点声……别让人误会了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E9F8FF076EB5B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1631149008:1":{"text":"Don't worry, I mean the dance, not right now.","source_cn":"不会的，我说的是舞会。又不是说现在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE67B7414F940929B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1631149009:1":{"text":"Um... It's a bit chilly here. Could we walk over to the library?","source_cn":"那个，劳伦……这里好像有风，我有点冷了。我们……去图书...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41497191039669B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1631149010:1":{"text":"Sure! The library's perfect. Quiet, cozy, and nobody will bother us there.","source_cn":"好啊！图书馆好，又安静又……没人打扰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C3F961C510BA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:女学生":{"text":"Female Student","source":"女学生","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:男学生":{"text":"Student","source":"男学生","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}